    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yosefu naarootorra ebirooto by'abaheereza ba Faraaho",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebi obu byahoire, omuheereza w'embonekyo hamu n'omwokya ab'omukama wa Misiri, bakasobeza mukama wabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Faraaho yabiihirirwa abaheereza abo ababiri: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yabakwata yabata omunju y'enkomo nambere Yosefu akaba akwatiirwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukama w'enkomo yabakwasa Yosefu abarolerre, na uwe nukwo yakozire, baamara akasumi omunju y'enkomo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiro kimu omu bwire bw'ekiro, bombi bakaroota, omuheereza w'embonekyo n'omwokya abakaba bakwasirwe omunju y'enkomo, buli omu yarootorra ekirooto kye, kandi buli kirooto kikaba kinyina amakuru gakyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosefu obu yabahikireho nyenkya, yarora nkooku batuntwire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho yakaguza abaheereza ba Faraaho aba akaba akwasirwe nabo omunju y'enkomo ei yaraaramuga, naagamba ati: “Kiro kinu, ka nimuzooka mwine obujune,” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "baamugarukamu bati: “Turoosire ebirooto baitu tubuzirwe araturootorra amakuru gabyo.” Yosefu yabagamba ati; “Okusoborra amakuru g'ebirooto, kuruga hali Ruhanga.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho omuheereza w'embonekyo yarootorra Yosefu ekirooto kye naagamba ati: “Omu kirooto kyange, ndozirege omuti omuzaabbibbu gundi omumaiso, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "omuzaabbibbu ogu gubaire gwina amataagi asatu, ahonaaho obu gusumikirege, gwayakya gwayana ebijuma, ebijuma byayenga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbaire nkwasire embonekyo y'omukama Faraaho, nanoga emizaabbibbu. Nagimigira omu mbonekyo ya Faraaho, nagimuheereza.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nubwo Yosefu yamusoboroire ati: “Amakuru ag'ekirooto eki, nugo ganu: amataagi asatu, nigamanyisa ebiro bisatu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ebiro bisatu bitakahoireho, Faraaho naija kukwiha omu nkomo akugarre ha mulimo gwawe, olyongera oheereze Faraaho embonekyo ye nkooku wakoraga kara, obu okaba oli muheereza we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu ebyawe obu biriba kurungi onyijuke kandi ongirre embabazi, ontonganirre hali Faraaho, nukwo na nyowe nduge omunju y'enkomo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habwokuba nkanyagwa naihwa omunsi ey'Abahebburaayo, kandi tinyina musango ogu ncwire ogw'okuntaisa mu nkomo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukuru w'abookya, obu yarozire Yosefu nkooku asoboroire kurungi amakuru ag'ekirooto kya mugenzi we, yamugambira ati: Na nyowe ndoosirege: “Nyetwekere ha mutwe ebigega bisatu ebinyakurumu emigaati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu kigega ekya haruguru, habaire harumu ebyokulya ebya buli mulingo ebinyakucumbiirwe Faraaho, baitu enyonyi zibaire nizibinsomera ha mutwe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosefu yamugamba ati: “Amakuru ag'ekirooto eki nugo ganu: Ebigega bisatu, nibimanyisa ebiro bisatu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ebiro bisatu bitakahingwireho, Faraaho naija kukwiha omu nkomo, akucweho omutwe kandi akuhanike ha muti, amahungu gakusome.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekiro ekya kasatu, ekikaba kiri kiro eky'okwijuka okuzaarwa kwa Faraaho, Faraaho akainura abaheereza be boona yaiha omu nkomo omuheereza w'embonekyo omukuru n'omwokya omukuru, abantu boona babarole. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuheereza w'embonekyo omukuru, yamugarra ha mulimo gwe, kandi yaheereza Faraaho embonekyo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "baitu omwokya omukuru, yamuhanika ha muti, Yosefu nkooku yabasoboroire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu nabwo, mukuru ow'abaheereza b'embonekyo, Yosefu akamwebwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
